{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54390","headline":"贞女石（相传秦时有数女游，卒遇风雨，一女化爲石。） · 张鸿","name":"贞女石（相传秦时有数女游，卒遇风雨，一女化爲石。）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"当时非望夫，亦不采蘼芜，自化爲贞质，因兹入画图。\n风恬潭镜朗，云散石房孤。\n寄语郴江妇，初心相似无。\n（见清黄子高辑《粤诗蒐逸》卷一，注出《连州志》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张鸿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54390.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54390","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}